### 2. Edge cases: empty line and a line with no errors
POST http://127.0.0.1:8001/api/process-manuscripts/correct
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "manuscript_id": "test-correction-edge",
  "lines": [
    {"index": 0, "text": ""},
    {"index": 1, "text": "Finis."}
  ]
}

### 3. Wrong plan: should return 400
POST http://127.0.0.1:8001/api/process-manuscripts/correct
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "manuscript_id": "test-correction-bad",
  "plan": "Translate",
  "lines": [{"index": 0, "text": "Finis."}]
}